(   ¶ A PALLIARD.                           ¶ A Pallyard.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  A Palliard is he that goeth in    These Palliardes ... go with patched) Tj T*
(  a patched cloke, and hys Doxy     clokes, and haue their Morts with) Tj T*
