(which, 'one who tooke vpon him to be speaker to the whole house,' began,) Tj T*
(as was the custom of their meeting, 'to make an oration in praise of) Tj T*
(Beggery, and of those that professe the trade,' which done, all the) Tj T*
(company departed, leaving the 'old beldam' and Dekker the only occupants) Tj T*
(of the room.) Tj T*
