(the memorial must have been considerable; while it is difficult to) Tj T*
(imagine a rational motive to account for such labour being incurred. To) Tj T*
(expand the abbreviations and modernize the orthography might have been) Tj T*
(expedient, as it would have been easy. But, in the name of reason, what) Tj T*
(is the gain of writing _wheare_ and _theare_ for "where" and "there;") Tj T*
(_cleere_, _yeeld_, and _meerly_ for "clere," "yealde," and "merely;") Tj T*
