(ech one his part of this their vile spoyle. Of this fraternity there be) Tj T*
(that be called helpers, which commonly haunt tauernes or alehouses, and) Tj T*
(co_m_meth in as men not acquainted with none in the companye, but spying) Tj T*
(them at any game, wil byd them God spede and God be at their game, and) Tj T*
(will so place him selfe that he will shew his fellow by sygnes and) Tj T*
(tokens, without speech commonly, but sometime with far fetched *[leaf) Tj T*
