(    ¶ _THE_ .XXV. =Orders of Knaues=, _otherwise called_ =a quarterne of) Tj T*
(    Knaues=, _confirmed for euer by Cocke Lorell_.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1 TROLL AND TROLL BY.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(TRoll and Trol by, is he that setteth naught by no man, nor no man by) Tj T*
(him. This is he that would beare rule in a place, and hath none) Tj T*
(authority nor thanke, & at last is thrust out of the doore like a knaue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 TROLL WITH.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Troll with is he _tha_t no man shall know the seruaunt from y^{e}) Tj T*
(Maister. This knaue with his cap on his head *[leaf 7b.]* lyke Capon) Tj T*
(hardy, wyll syt downe by his Maister, or els go cheeke by cheeke with) Tj T*
(him in the streete.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TROLL HAZARD OF TRACE.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
