(Troll hazard of trace is he that goeth behynde his Maister as far as he) Tj T*
(may see hym. Such knaues commonly vse to buy Spice-cakes, Apples, or) Tj T*
(other trifles, and doo eate them as they go in the streetes lyke) Tj T*
(vacabond Boyes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Header: AWDELEY. THE .XXV. ORDERS OF KNAUES.]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TROLL HAZARD OF TRITRACE.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Troll hazard of tritrace, is he that goeth gaping after his Master,) Tj T*
(looking to and fro tyl he haue lost him. This knaue goeth gasyng about) Tj T*
(lyke a foole at euery toy, and then seeketh in euery house lyke a) Tj T*
(Maisterles dog, and when his Maister nedeth him, he is to seeke.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 CHAFE LITTER.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Chafe Litter is he that wyll plucke vp the Fether-bed or Matrice, and) Tj T*
(pysse in the bedstraw, and wyl neuer ryse vncalled. This knaue berayeth) Tj T*
(many tymes in the corners of his Maisters chamber, or other places) Tj T*
(inconuenient, and maketh cleane hys shooes with the couerlet or) Tj T*
(curtaines.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 OBLOQUIUM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Obloquium is hee that wyll take a tale out of his Maisters mouth and) Tj T*
(tell it him selfe. He of right may be called a malapart knaue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7 RINCE PYTCHER.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rince Pytcher is he that will drinke out his thrift at the ale or wine,) Tj T*
(and be oft times dronke. This is a licoryce knaue that will swill his) Tj T*
(Maisters drink, and brybe his meate that is kept for him.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8 JEFFREY GODS FO.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Jeffery Gods Fo is he, that wil sweare & maintaine *[leaf 8]* othes.) Tj T*
(This is such a lying knaue that none wil beleue him, for the more he) Tj T*
(sweareth, y_e_ les he is to be beleued.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9 NICHOL HARTLES.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Nichol Hartles is he, that when he should do ought for his Maister hys) Tj T*
(hart faileth him. This is a Trewand knaue that faineth himselfe sicke) Tj T*
(when he should woorke.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10 SIMON SOONE AGON.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Simon soone agon is he, that when his Mayster hath any thing to do, he) Tj T*
(wil hide him out of the way. This is a loytring knaue that wil hide him) Tj T*
(in a corner and sleepe or els run away.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(11 GRENE WINCHARD.) Tj T*
