(meaneth nothinge lesse. Yf he be offered any meate or drynke, he) Tj T*
(vtterlye refusethe scornefully, and wyll nought but money; and yf he) Tj T*
(espye yong pyges or pultry, he well noteth the place, and they the next) Tj T*
