(some what to suspecte, because neither he nor his man could se nor find) Tj T*
(him. Then this Gentleman deligentlye enquired of thre or foure towne) Tj T*
(dwellers there whether any such person, declaring his stature,[81] age,) Tj T*
(apparell, with so many linaments of his body as he could call to) Tj T*
(remembraunce. And, "vna voce," all sayde that no such man dwelt in their) Tj T*
(streate, neither in the parish, that they knewe of; but some did wel) Tj T*
