(they haue a briefe of the Queenes maiesties letters patentes, geuen to) Tj T*
(suche[83] poore spitlehouse for the reliefe of _th_e poore there, whiche) Tj T*
(briefe is a coppie of the letters patentes, _and_ vtterly fained, if it) Tj T*
