(THese Abrahom men be those that fayne themselues to haue beene mad, and) Tj T*
(haue bene kept eyther in Bethelem or in some other pryson a good tyme,) Tj T*
(_and_ not one amongst twenty that euer came in pryson for any such) Tj T*
