(agayne." "Yf it be méete and necessary," q_uo_d I, "it shall lye vnder) Tj T*
(my feete." "What meane you by that?" quoth she. "I meane," q_uo_d I, "to) Tj T*
(hide the same, and neuer to discouer it to any." "Well," q_uoth_ she,) Tj T*
