([Header: HARMAN. A DELL.]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(*[leaf 24, back]* ¶ A DELL. Cap. 21.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A Dell is a yonge wenche, able for generation, and not yet knowen or) Tj T*
(broken by the vpright man. These go abroade yong, eyther by the death of) Tj T*
(their parentes, and no bodye to looke vnto them, or els by some sharpe) Tj T*
(mystres that they serue, do runne away out of seruice; eyther she is) Tj T*
(naturally borne one, and then she is a wyld Dell: these are broken verye) Tj T*
(yonge; when they haue béene lyen with all by the vpright man, then they) Tj T*
(be Doxes, and no Dels. These wylde dels, beinge traded vp with their) Tj T*
(monstrous mothers, must of necessytie be as euill, or worsse, then their) Tj T*
(parents, for neither we gather grapes from gréene bryars, neither fygs) Tj T*
(from Thystels. But such buds, such blosoms, such euyll sede sowen, wel) Tj T*
(worsse beinge growen.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Header: HARMAN. A KYNCHIN MORTE, ETC.]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(¶ A KYNCHIN MORTE. Cap. 22.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A Kynching Morte is a lytle Gyrle: the Mortes their mothers carries them) Tj T*
(at their backes in their slates, whiche is their shetes, and bryngs them) Tj T*
(vp sauagely[151], tyll they growe to be rype, and soone rype, soone) Tj T*
(rotten.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(¶ A KYNCHEN CO. Cap. 23.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A Kynchen Co is a young boye, traden vp to suche peuishe purposes as you) Tj T*
(haue harde of other young ympes before, that when he groweth vnto yeres,) Tj T*
(he is better to hang then to drawe forth.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([Header: HARMAN. DOXES VSAGE IN THE NIGHT.]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(¶ THEIR VSAGE IN THE NIGHT. Cap. 24.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(NOw I thinke it not vnnecessary to make the Reader vnderstand how and in) Tj T*
(what maner they lodge a nights in barnes or backe houses, and of their) Tj T*
(vsage there, for asmuch as I haue acquaynted them with their order and) Tj T*
