(on Newe yeares day last past, Anno domini. 1567, and commytted vnto a) Tj T*
(offescer, who caried hym vnto the depetye of the ward, which co_m_mytted) Tj T*
(hym vnto the counter; _and_ as the counstable and a nother would haue) Tj T*
